nize that individual actions in favor of transparency play an important role in developing norms that preserve the integrity of the community. Reviewers will be specifically instructed to not penalize honesty concerning limitations.\n38\n\nShell cwd was reset to /hutian/repo\n```", "exit": null}}}, {"id": "e66b2d4c-b073-5f59-9152-75912bd1a5e1", "at": 1795686451.427053, "clock": "host", "stream": "runner", "sequence": 86572, "layer": "worker", "category": "message", "kind": "session.session/request_permission", "role": "venue-repo", "actor": "venue-repo", "execution_id": "cd8ae3fe9b0d5457ac21766d50fd78fe", "trust": "agent-reported", "outcome": null, "label": "message", "repository": null, "flags": [], "causes": [], "summary": "session/request_permission"}, {"id": "5511bb6e-1f9a-5728-a7b6-a7aafc6afecf", "at": 1795686451.4310656, "clock": "host", "stream": "runner", "sequence": 86573, "layer": "worker", "category": "message", "kind": "session.response", "role": "venue-repo", "actor": "venue-repo", "execution_id": "cd8ae3fe9b0d5457ac21766d50fd78fe", "trust": "agent-reported", "outcome": null, "label": "message", "repository": null, "flags": [], "causes": [], "summary": "response"}, {"id": "55d387f0-ea43-52e2-825f-7565bbb68b7c", "at": 1795686451.4346843, "clock": "host", "stream": "runner", "sequence": 86574, "layer": "worker", "category": "usage", "kind": "session.usage", "role": "venue-repo", "actor": "venue-repo", "execution_id": "cd8ae3fe9b0d5457ac21766d50fd78fe", "trust": "agent-reported", "outcome": null, "label": "usage", "repository": null, "flags": [], "causes": [], "summary": "context usage"}, {"id": "b8dd2a5f-75bc-5bca-b34b-18f3a828dbfc", "at": 1795686451.490015, "clock": "host", "stream": "runner", "sequence": 86575, "layer": "worker", "category": "challenge", "kind": "authentication.challenge", "role": "venue-repo", "actor": "unknown", "execution_id": "cd8ae3fe9b0d5457ac21766d50fd78fe", "trust": "system-confirmed", "outcome": "credential-required", "label": 